"""Every VyOS template: zone-based firewall and the same management part (2026-10-27: "all vyos must zone based
firewall and unified access to mgmt interface"). The routers that had the input filter (rr-vxlan, l2-a, l2-b, l2-br) get
zones: rr-vxlan an IX zone on eth1 (BGP, ping, established/related with the underlay and its BGP peers), l2-a / l2-b an
S2S zone on eth1 (WireGuard with the other side) and a TUN zone on the WireGuard interface (VXLAN with the other side),
l2-br only the local zone (its interfaces bridge). Every router: the local zone GW and the zone MGMT (eth0 and VRF
MGMT), ping and ssh from the management hosts only — the same lines everywhere. Templates edited by hand so that the
old block is not found stay as they are (reported). Backward: restore the database backup taken before the release."""
